  "name": "Spinach, chickpea and mushroom plate",
  "description": "A soy-free plate for lunch or dinner: mushrooms browned in dry pans with chickpeas and cooked lentils, a large amount of spinach wilted in at the end, finished with sunflower seeds and basil.",
