  "instructions": [
    "Set two wide non-stick pans over high heat, divide the mushrooms between them in a single layer and leave them undisturbed for 3 minutes.",
    "Stir once, add the salt, and cook for 3 minutes more until the pans are dry again.",
    "Divide the chickpeas and the lentils between the pans and warm them through for 2 minutes, pressing the chickpeas lightly so they take on colour.",
    "Fold in the spinach a large handful at a time and cook for 2 minutes, just until it collapses.",
    "Divide between two plates, then scatter the sunflower seeds and the torn basil over the top."
